<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Additional Details on Our Instruction Dataset</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Details of the Datasets</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ A.1 Details of the Datasets ‣ Appendix A Additional Details on Our Instruction Dataset ‣ Instruction Tuning of Large Language Models for Tabular Data Generation—in One Day" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> tabulates the details of the public datasets used to create our instruction dataset for tabular data generation.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A1.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="A1.T3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">We sample 20 publicly available datasets to create our instruction dataset for tabular data generation. To ensure diversity, these datasets are sampled from 10 different topics. For each dataset (table), <math id="A1.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math> denote the number of rows (samples) and the number of columns (features), respectively. <span id="A1.T3.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Train</span> indicates whether a dataset is used during training.</span></figcaption>
<div id="A1.T3.6" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:181.8pt;vertical-align:-89.3pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-71.2pt,37.5pt) scale(0.707953983517107,0.707953983517107) ;">
<table id="A1.T3.6.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T3.6.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T3.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T3.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">Topic</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.6.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T3.6.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">Dataset</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.6.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><math id="A1.T3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℛ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T3.6.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><math id="A1.T3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒞</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T3.6.1.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T3.6.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">Train</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T3.6.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T3.6.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" rowspan="4"><span id="A1.T3.6.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Consumer and Market Analysis</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.6.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T3.6.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">Amazon Top 50 Bestselling Books (2009-2019)</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.6.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T3.6.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">550</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.6.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T3.6.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">7</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.6.1.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T3.6.1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">✓</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T3.6.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
